Questions about the use of Hoover

Read the manual before you answer a question about the use of Hoover.

{% if has('search_manual') %}
1. Call {{ tool('search_manual') }} with the words of the question.
{% endif %}
{% if has('read_manual') %}
2. Read the best sections with {{ tool('read_manual') }}. Give the section that the search returned.
{% endif %}
3. Answer from the text of the manual. Write the answer in your answer language, also when the manual is in another language.
